<newsitem itemid="154737" id="root" date="1996-10-30" xml:lang="en">
<title>FRANCE: Cathay orders three more Airbus.</title>
<headline>Cathay orders three more Airbus.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>European plane manufacturer Airbus Industrie said Cathay Pacific Airways had signed a contract for three more ulta long-range A340-300 planes, increasing to nine its number of firm orders.</p>
<p>It gave no financial details.</p>
</text>
